;; System announcements — the :system source of the Feed.
;;
;; A file, not a table: these are authored by whoever runs the deployment, they
;; are the same for everyone, and they change without anyone's data changing.
;; Read per request rather than at load, so editing this file is enough — no
;; restart, no migration, and no schema for three sentences.
;;
;; When a per-user or dismissible announcement is genuinely needed, THAT wants a
;; row (who saw what, when). This does not, and giving it one now would be a
;; table nobody writes to.
;;
;; :at is when it was published; :kind drives the icon and colour.
[{:id :usage-limits-2026-07
  :kind :limits
  :at #inst "2026-07-24T09:00:00.000-00:00"
  :title "Usage limits raised"
  :body "Per-workspace model budgets are up 4× for the alpha. Existing budgets
         are unchanged — raise yours in Settings if you want the headroom."}

